---
pagination:
  data: collections.golf
  size: 1
  alias: golf
permalink: "/golf/{{ golf.data.slug or (golf.data.title | slugify) }}/index.html"
layout: base.njk
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="listing-hero detail-heading"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/golf/">Golf</a> / {{ golf.data.title }}</nav><span class="eyebrow">{{ golf.data.neighborhood }} · {{ golf.data.category }}</span><h1>{{ golf.data.title }}</h1><p class="lead">{{ golf.data.tagline or golf.data.excerpt }}</p></div></section>
<div class="container"><div class="guide-columns"><article><h2>About the venue</h2>{{ golf.templateContent | safe }}{% if golf.data.status_note %}<div class="notice"><strong>Access notice</strong><p>{{ golf.data.status_note }}</p></div>{% endif %}<h2>Before booking a round</h2><p>{{ golf.data.booking_note }}</p><ul class="highlight-list"><li>Ask the club about visitor access, tee times and any handicap certificate requirements.</li><li>Confirm the full rate, cancellation terms, equipment hire and included transfers.</li><li>Check the specific course in use, maintenance dates and seasonal conditions.</li></ul>{% set galleryItem = golf.data %}{% include 'editorial-gallery.njk' %}{% set relatedItem = golf.data %}{% include 'related-guide.njk' %}</article><aside class="planning-card"><span class="eyebrow">Go to the source</span><h2>Plan your round</h2><p>{{ golf.data.neighborhood }}</p><a class="btn btn-orange" href="{{ golf.data.official_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official golf website ↗</a><p class="source-note">Source reviewed <time datetime="{{ golf.data.last_checked }}">{{ golf.data.last_checked }}</time>. <a href="{{ golf.data.source_url }}">{{ golf.data.source_label or 'Official venue information' }}</a>. This is not live tee-time inventory.</p><a href="/hotels/?q=Belek">Find a Belek hotel →</a><a href="/golf/">Compare golf venues →</a></aside></div></div>
